// The imperfect automaton plays the perfect one's table as it is: the same
// moves, under the same move ids. It borrows with no prefixes and authors no
// moves of its own, so there is one table to tune (`cellular_automaton.ron`).
// To give it a move of its own, name prefixes so its ids are its own.
(
    schema_version: 1,
    entities: [
        (
            id: "imperfect_cellular_automaton",
            contracts: (
                borrows: Some((
                    archetype: "perfect_cellular_automaton",
                    prefixes: [],
                )),
            ),
        ),
    ],
)
